  "posts": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Make it Happen is out",
      "slug": "make-it-happen-is-out",
      "excerpt": "The new single is out.",
      "body": "Make it Happen is out today. It started as a sketch at the piano and refused to stay small.\n\nThe left hand found the time, the right hand kept the melody in the open, and the last pass got one more chorus of chords than planned. If it finds you late, that is when it was written.\n\nThank you for waiting on it. The next rooms are on the tour page.",
      "coverImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464375117522-1311d6a5b81f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80",
      "published": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-11-06T16:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T19:38:35.357Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "The long way through the tour",
      "slug": "the-long-way-through-the-tour",
      "excerpt": "Dates, vans, and the cities where the second chorus of chords got louder.",
      "body": "The dates are up. The run moves through Jacmel, Jeremie, Les Cayes, and Cap Haitien.\n\nSoundcheck is at five when the room allows it. If you are coming early, the quiet pieces happen first. If you are coming late, stay for the last one anyway.\n\nTickets land city by city. If your town is missing, write — the list is not finished.",
      "coverImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1429962714451-bb934ecdc4ec?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80",
      "published": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-28T15:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T19:38:35.358Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "What we played in the van",
      "slug": "what-we-played-in-the-van",
      "excerpt": "A short list from the miles between the last two rooms.",
      "body": "The aux cord has a hierarchy. Up-tempo records win in the afternoon. Ballads win after midnight. Someone always puts on a piece we were trying not to be influenced by, and then we are.\n\nA few that stayed in the rotation: a hymn from childhood, a standard that keeps changing key, and a piano sketch that might be the next single.\n\nIf you have a song the van should hear, send it with the contact form. We actually read those.",
      "coverImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506157786151-b8491531f063?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80",
      "published": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-14T18:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T19:38:35.358Z"
    }
  ],
